{"sourceUrl":"http://www.qdio.ac.cn/yjs/zsxx/xly/202604/t20260424_835083.html","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:43.209287+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://www.qdio.ac.cn/yjs/zsxx/xly/202604/t20260424_835083.html","html":"<div>\n<div><p><span>为激发高校</span><span><span>优秀</span></span><span>本科生</span><span>的</span><span><span>科研兴趣和热情，</span></span><span>培育</span><span>科学</span><span>素养</span><span>，</span><span><span>沉浸式感受海洋科学的独特魅力，深入了解海洋科技前沿与创新发展前景</span></span><span><span>，中国科学院海洋研究所将于</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span>年</span><span><span>7</span><span>月</span></span><span>举办</span><span>“海洋科学”暑期夏令营活动，欢迎优秀本科生报名参加！</span></p><p><strong><span>一、活动安排</span></strong></p><p><span>报名时间：</span><span><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>4</span><span>月</span><span>25</span><span>日—</span><span>6</span><span>月</span><span>25</span><span>日</span></span></p><p><span>夏令营</span><span><span>时间：</span></span><span>预计</span><span>202</span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年</span>7<span>月</span></span><span><span>14</span><span>日</span><span>-17</span><span>日</span></span><span><span>，线下举行</span></span><span>，</span><span>时间如有变化另行通知</span></p><p><span><span>招收人数：</span><span>100-150</span><span>人</span></span></p><p><span>有关夏令营相关安排请以我所网站后续通知为准。</span></p><p><strong><span>二</span></strong><strong><span><span>、申请条件</span></span></strong></p><p><span>1<span>、海洋科学、生物学、水产、化学、生态学、地质、地球物理、物理、数学、计算机、环境科学、环境工程、大气科学</span></span><span>、</span><span><span>材料科学等</span></span><span>相关</span><span><span>专业</span></span><span><span>202</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span>届优秀应届本科毕业生（即大三在读本科生）</span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><span>海洋所招生专业：</span></span></p><p><span><span>学术型：物理海洋学、气象学、海洋化学、海洋生物学、海洋地质、海洋生态学、海洋腐蚀与防护、环境科学、环境工程、水产养殖</span></span></p><p><span><span>专业型：生物与医药</span></span><span>、</span><span><span>环境工程、地质工程</span></span></p><p><span>2<span>、学习成绩优秀，无违法违纪受处分记录，</span></span><span>英语需达到国家四级</span><span>及以上</span><span>水平。</span></p><p><span>3<span>、有志于海洋科学研究工作，有较好的科研潜力；参与过科研项目，发表过</span><span>SCI</span><span>、中文核心论文或者获得过发明专利等科研成果的同学优先考虑。</span></span></p><p><strong><span>三</span></strong><strong><span><span>、</span></span></strong><strong><span>奖助</span></strong><strong><span><span>体系</span></span></strong></p><p><span>我所研究生在学期间实行奖助学金制度，根据年级、攻读学位和科研课题的不同分别</span><span><span>为：</span></span><span>博士奖助学金</span><span>4</span><span><span>850</span></span><span><span>-</span></span><span>5</span><span><span>35</span></span><span>0</span><span><span>元</span><span>/</span><span>月，硕士奖助学金一年级</span><span>2</span></span><span><span>300</span></span><span><span>元</span><span>/</span><span>月，二、三年级</span><span>2</span></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>00-3</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>00</span><span>元</span><span>/</span><span>月，另有全覆盖的学业奖学金，硕士平均</span><span>8000</span><span>元</span><span>/</span><span>年，博士平均</span><span>1300</span></span><span><span>0</span></span><span><span>元</span><span>/</span><span>年。</span></span><span>成绩优异者还可申请国家奖学金及中国科学院院长</span><span><span>奖、</span></span><span>各类冠名奖学金及</span><span><span>研究</span></span><span>所</span><span><span>奖学金</span></span><span>。</span></p><p><strong><span><span>四、网上申请流程</span></span></strong></p><p><span>1<span>、个人信息填报</span></span></p><p><span><span>报名网址：</span></span><span>http://zxsq.ucas.ac.cn/login/index/sc</span></p><p><span><span>截止时间：</span></span><span>202</span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年</span>6<span>月</span></span><span><span>25</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p><p><span><span>网上报名一旦发现材料有作假行为，将取消营员资格。</span></span></p><p><span>2<span>、资格审核</span></span></p><p><span>研究所</span><span><span>将于</span></span><span><span>6</span><span>月</span><span>26</span><span>日—</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>3</span><span>日</span></span><span><span>进行资格审核</span></span><span><span>，申请人可通过报名系统查询申请是否通过</span></span><span>，</span><span>审核通过者需</span><span>在系统</span><span>确认</span><span>是否同意参加，超过时限将视为自动放弃。</span><span><span>未入选者，不再另行通知。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3</span><span>、报名回执</span></span></p><p><span>申请人完成网报系统提交后，请扫描</span><span><span>以下二维码</span></span><span>填写报名回执信息。</span></p><p><br/></p><p><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://www.qdio.ac.cn/yjs/zsxx/xly/202604/W020260424589340503885_ORIGIN.jpg\"/></p><p><strong><span><span>五、材料提交</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>申请阶段无需提供材料，正式录取为夏令营营员后需</span></span><span>在</span><span><span>报到</span></span><span>当天</span><span><span>提交</span></span><span>以下</span><span><span>纸质材料</span></span><span>。</span></p><p><span><span>1</span><span>、《中国科学院海洋研究所</span><span>20</span></span><span>2</span><span><span>6</span></span><span>年海洋科学暑期夏令营申请表》（详见附件，填写完整院系推荐意见栏必须有所在学院或系公章）；</span></p><p><span><span>2</span><span>、盖有所在学校教务部门或院系公章的大学本科前三年所修课程成绩单（五年制的提供前四年课程成绩单）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3</span></span><span>、</span><span>专业排名证明（加盖</span><span>院系公章</span><span>）；</span></p><p><span><span>4</span></span><span>、学生证、身份证复印件</span><span><span>，</span></span><span>原件报到</span><span><span>时查验</span></span><span>；</span></p><p><span><span>5</span></span><span>、《个人简历及自述》（详见附件）；</span></p><p><span><span>6</span><span>、《优秀营员表》</span></span><span>（详见附件</span><span>，</span><span>只</span><span><span>填封面</span></span><span>内容</span><span><span>即可</span></span><span>）</span><span>；</span></p><p><span><span>7</span></span><span>、</span><span>英语四六级成绩单</span><span><span>或其他</span></span><span>外语水平</span><span>证明</span><span><span>材料</span></span><span>；</span></p><p><span><span>8</span></span><span>、个人获奖、发表论文等证明材料</span><span>复印件，原件报</span><span>到</span><span><span>时查验</span></span><span>（</span><span>若无可不提交</span><span>）</span><span>；</span></p><p><span><span>9</span><span>、</span></span><span>安全责任书（</span><span>详见附件，需</span><span>本人签字）</span><span>。</span></p><p><strong><span>以上材料提交后不再返还，重要材料请提供复印件。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>六</span></strong><strong><span><span>、联系方式</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>研究生部主页：</span>http://www.qdio.ac.cn/yjs/</span></p><p><span><span>微信公众号：中国科学院海洋研究所研究生教育</span></span></p><p><span><span>海洋所</span></span><span>招生</span><span><span>咨询</span></span><span><span>QQ</span></span><span><span>群号：</span><span>1025227594</span></span></p><p><span><span>联系人：</span></span><span>刘</span><span><span>老师</span></span><span>、</span><span>宋老师</span></p><p><span><span>联系电话：</span></span><span>0532-8289865</span><span><span>4</span><span>、</span><span>0532-82898652</span></span></p><p><span>Email<span>：</span><span>yjsb@qdio.ac.cn</span></span></p><p><span><span>地址：山东省青岛市</span></span><span><span>黄岛区海军路</span><span>88</span><span>号乙中国科学院大学海洋学院教学楼</span></span><span><span>，中国科学院海洋研究所研究生部</span></span></p><p><span><span>有关夏令营活动的相关安排后续将在网站通知，请同学们及时关注海洋所研究生教育网站。</span></span></p><p><br/></p></div>\n</div>","textSha256":"d3fad8cd0952e22c2deeed6d6e407075bbd3c6c2fb12aa5a7277c5f7265f1aec","textLength":1452,"sourceSha256":"2a265342748359c036cc126827da44ca488b31a51051be5173bef08d4bf07905","selector":"#zoom","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-165952e07d040d24c688","title":"2026年中国科学院海洋研究所2026年海洋科学暑期夏令营报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:43.209287+00:00"}
